;; What `/<tool> args` asks the model (byj-gly.273.2) — brainyard's slash path,
;; word for word (agent_tui/commands.clj handle-tool-dispatch). A nudge, not a
;; forced call: the model reads it as the person's question and may answer it
;; another way. {tool} is the tool's id, {args} the rest of the line as typed.
{:with-args "call directly as a tool: {tool} for {args}"
 :no-args "call directly as a tool: {tool}"}
